\q2 \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb remain|יִשָּׁאֵ֖ר\rb* \rb from Assyria,|מֵֽאַשּׁ֑וּר\rb*
\q1 \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb there was|הָֽיְתָה֙\rb* \rb for Israel|לְיִשְׂרָאֵ֔ל\rb*
\q2 \rb when|בְּי֥וֹם\rb* \rb they came up|עֲלֹת֖וֹ\rb* \rb from the land|מֵאֶ֥רֶץ\rb* \rb of Egypt.|מִצְרָֽיִם׃\rb*
\c 12
\s1 Joyful Thanksgiving
\p \v 1 \rb In that|הַה֔וּא\rb* \rb day|בַּיּ֣וֹם\rb* \rb you will say:|וְאָֽמַרְתָּ֙\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “O LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb I will praise You.|אוֹדְךָ֣\rb*
\q2 \rb Although|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb You were angry|אָנַ֖פְתָּ\rb* \rb with me,|בִּ֑י\rb*
\q1 \rb Your anger|אַפְּךָ֖\rb* \rb has turned away,|יָשֹׁ֥ב\rb*
\q2 \rb and You have comforted me.|וּֽתְנַחֲמֵֽנִי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb Surely|הִנֵּ֨ה\rb* \rb God|אֵ֧ל\rb* \rb is my salvation;|יְשׁוּעָתִ֛י\rb*
\q2 \rb I will trust|אֶבְטַ֖ח\rb* \rb and not|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb be afraid.|אֶפְחָ֑ד\rb*
\q1 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the LORD|יָ֣הּ\rb* \rb GOD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb is my strength|עָזִּ֤י\rb* \rb and my song,|וְזִמְרָת֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and He also has become|וַֽיְהִי־\rb* \rb my|לִ֖י\rb* \rb salvation.”|לִֽישׁוּעָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 3 \rb With joy|בְּשָׂשׂ֑וֹן\rb* \rb you will draw|וּשְׁאַבְתֶּם־\rb* \rb water|מַ֖יִם\rb* \rb from the springs|מִמַּעַיְנֵ֖י\rb* \rb of salvation,|הַיְשׁוּעָֽה׃\rb* \v 4 \rb and on that|הַה֗וּא\rb* \rb day|בַּיּ֣וֹם\rb* \rb you will say:|וַאֲמַרְתֶּ֞ם\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “Give praise|הוֹד֤וּ\rb* \rb to the LORD;|לַֽיהוָה֙\rb*
\q2 \rb proclaim|קִרְא֣וּ\rb* \rb His name!|בִשְׁמ֔וֹ\rb*
\q1 \rb Make|הוֹדִ֥יעוּ\rb* \rb His works known|עֲלִֽילֹתָ֑יו\rb* \rb among the peoples;|בָֽעַמִּ֖ים\rb*
\q2 \rb declare|הַזְכִּ֕ירוּ\rb* \rb that|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb His name|שְׁמֽוֹ׃\rb* \rb is exalted.|נִשְׂגָּ֖ב\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb Sing|זַמְּר֣וּ\rb* \rb to the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb for|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb He has done|עָשָׂ֑ה\rb* \rb glorious things.|גֵא֖וּת\rb*
\q2 \rb Let this|זֹ֖את\rb* \rb be known|מְיֻדַּעַת\rb* \rb in all|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb the earth.|הָאָֽרֶץ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb Cry out|צַהֲלִ֥י\rb* \rb and sing,|וָרֹ֖נִּי\rb* \rb O citizen|יוֹשֶׁ֣בֶת\rb* \rb of Zion,|צִיּ֑וֹן\rb*
\q2 \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb great|גָד֥וֹל\rb* \rb among you|בְּקִרְבֵּ֖ךְ\rb* \rb is the Holy|קְד֥וֹשׁ\rb* \rb One of Israel.”|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃פ\rb*
\c 13
\s1 The Burden against Babylon
\p \v 1 \rb This is the burden|מַשָּׂ֖א\rb* \rb against Babylon|בָּבֶ֑ל\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb Isaiah|יְשַׁעְיָ֖הוּ\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Amoz|אָמֽוֹץ׃\rb* \rb received:|חָזָ֔ה\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 2 \rb Raise|שְֽׂאוּ־\rb* \rb a banner|נֵ֔ס\rb* \rb on|עַ֤ל\rb* \rb a barren|נִשְׁפֶּה֙\rb* \rb hilltop;|הַר־\rb*
