\q2 \rb that they may enter|וְיָבֹ֖אוּ\rb* \rb the gates|פִּתְחֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the nobles.|נְדִיבִֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb I|אֲנִ֥י\rb* \rb have commanded|צִוֵּ֖יתִי\rb* \rb My sanctified ones;|לִמְקֻדָּשָׁ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb I have even|גַּ֣ם\rb* \rb summoned|קָרָ֤אתִי\rb* \rb My warriors|גִבּוֹרַי֙\rb*
\q1 \rb to execute My wrath|לְאַפִּ֔י\rb*
\q2 \rb and exult|עַלִּיזֵ֖י\rb* \rb in My triumph.|גַּאֲוָתִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb Listen,|ק֥וֹל\rb* \rb a tumult|הָמ֛וֹן\rb* \rb on the mountains,|בֶּֽהָרִ֖ים\rb*
\q2 \rb like that|דְּמ֣וּת\rb* \rb of a great|רָ֑ב\rb* \rb multitude!|עַם־\rb*
