\q2 \rb like nations|גּוֹיִם֙\rb* \rb gathered together!|נֶֽאֱסָפִ֔ים\rb*
\q1 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb of Hosts|צְבָא֔וֹת\rb* \rb is mobilizing|מְפַקֵּ֖ד\rb*
\q2 \rb an army|צְבָ֥א\rb* \rb for war.|מִלְחָמָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb They are coming|בָּאִ֛ים\rb* \rb from faraway|מֶרְחָ֖ק\rb* \rb lands,|מֵאֶ֥רֶץ\rb*
\q2 \rb from the ends|מִקְצֵ֣ה\rb* \rb of the heavens—|הַשָּׁמָ֑יִם\rb*
\q1 \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb and the weapons|וּכְלֵ֣י\rb* \rb of His wrath—|זַעְמ֔וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb to destroy|לְחַבֵּ֖ל\rb* \rb the whole|כָּל־\rb* \rb country.|הָאָֽרֶץ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 6 \rb Wail,|הֵילִ֕ילוּ\rb* \rb for|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb the Day|י֣וֹם\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb is near;|קָר֖וֹב\rb*
\q2 \rb it will come|יָבֽוֹא׃\rb* \rb as destruction|כְּשֹׁ֖ד\rb* \rb from the Almighty.|מִשַּׁדַּ֥י\rb*\f + \fr 13:6 \ft Hebrew \fqa Shaddai\f*
\q1 \v 7 \rb Therefore|עַל־\rb*\rb |כֵּ֖ן\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb hands|יָדַ֣יִם\rb* \rb will fall limp,|תִּרְפֶּ֑ינָה\rb*
\q2 \rb and every|וְכָל־\rb* \rb man’s|אֱנ֖וֹשׁ\rb* \rb heart|לְבַ֥ב\rb* \rb will melt.|יִמָּס׃\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb Terror,|וְֽנִבְהָ֓לוּ׀\rb* \rb pain,|צִירִ֤ים\rb* \rb and anguish|וַֽחֲבָלִים֙\rb* \rb will seize them;|יֹֽאחֵז֔וּן\rb*
\q2 \rb they will writhe|יְחִיל֑וּן\rb* \rb like a woman in labor.|כַּיּוֹלֵדָ֖ה\rb*
\q1 \rb They will look at|אֶל־\rb* \rb one|אִ֤ישׁ\rb* \rb another,|רֵעֵ֙הוּ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb their faces|פְּנֵ֥י\rb* \rb flushed|לְהָבִ֖ים\rb*\rb |פְּנֵיהֶֽם׃\rb* \rb with fear.|יִתְמָ֔הוּ\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb Behold,|הִנֵּ֤ה\rb* \rb the Day|יוֹם־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb is coming—|בָּ֔א\rb*
\q2 \rb cruel,|אַכְזָרִ֥י\rb* \rb with fury|וְעֶבְרָ֖ה\rb* \rb and burning anger—|וַחֲר֣וֹן\rb*\rb |אָ֑ף\rb*
\q1 \rb to make|לָשׂ֤וּם\rb* \rb the earth|הָאָ֙רֶץ֙\rb* \rb a desolation|לְשַׁמָּ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and to destroy|יַשְׁמִ֥יד\rb* \rb the sinners|וְחַטָּאֶ֖יהָ\rb* \rb within it.|מִמֶּֽנָּה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 10 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the stars|כוֹכְבֵ֤י\rb* \rb of heaven|הַשָּׁמַ֙יִם֙\rb* \rb and their constellations|וּכְסִ֣ילֵיהֶ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb will not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb give|יָהֵ֖לּוּ\rb* \rb their light.|אוֹרָ֑ם\rb*
\q1 \rb The rising|בְּצֵאת֔וֹ\rb* \rb sun|הַשֶּׁ֙מֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb will be darkened,|חָשַׁ֤ךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb and the moon|וְיָרֵ֖חַ\rb* \rb will not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb give|יַגִּ֥יהַ\rb* \rb its light.|אוֹרֽוֹ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb I will punish|וּפָקַדְתִּ֤י\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb the world|תֵּבֵל֙\rb* \rb for its evil|רָעָ֔ה\rb*
