\q2 \rb from the land|מֵאֶ֥רֶץ\rb* \rb of Cyprus.|כִּתִּ֖ים\rb*\f + \fr 23:1 \ft Hebrew \fqa Kittim\ft ; also in verse 12\f*
\q1 \v 2 \rb Be silent,|דֹּ֖מּוּ\rb* \rb O dwellers|יֹ֣שְׁבֵי\rb* \rb of the coastland,|אִ֑י\rb*
