\q2 \rb and His arm|וּזְרֹע֖וֹ\rb* \rb establishes His rule.|מֹ֣שְׁלָה\rb*\rb |ל֑וֹ\rb*
\q1 \rb His reward|שְׂכָרוֹ֙\rb* \rb is with Him,|אִתּ֔וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb and His recompense|וּפְעֻלָּת֖וֹ\rb* \rb accompanies Him.|לְפָנָֽיו׃\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb He tends|כְּרֹעֶה֙\rb* \rb His flock|עֶדְר֣וֹ\rb* \rb like a shepherd;|יִרְעֶ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb He gathers|יְקַבֵּ֣ץ\rb* \rb the lambs|טְלָאִ֔ים\rb* \rb in His arms|בִּזְרֹעוֹ֙\rb*
\q1 \rb and carries them|יִשָּׂ֑א\rb* \rb close to His heart.|וּבְחֵיק֖וֹ\rb*
