\b 
\q1 \v 12 \rb Who|מִֽי־\rb* \rb has measured|מָדַ֨ד\rb* \rb the waters|מַ֗יִם\rb* \rb in the hollow of his hand,|בְּשָׁעֳל֜וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb or marked off|תִּכֵּ֔ן\rb* \rb the heavens|וְשָׁמַ֙יִם֙\rb* \rb with the span of his hand?|בַּזֶּ֣רֶת\rb*
