\q2 \rb and the hills|וּגְבָע֖וֹת\rb* \rb with a balance?|בְּמֹאזְנָֽיִם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 13 \rb Who|מִֽי־\rb* \rb has directed|תִכֵּ֥ן\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Spirit|ר֖וּחַ\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*\f + \fr 40:13 \ft Or \fqa mind of the LORD\ft ; see also LXX.\f*\rb |וְאִ֥ישׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb or informed Him|יוֹדִיעֶֽנּוּ׃\rb* \rb as His counselor?|עֲצָת֖וֹ\rb*\f + \fr 40:13 \ft Cited in \ref Romans 11:34|ROM 11:34\ref* and 1 Corinthians 2:16\f*
\q1 \v 14 \rb Whom|מִ֤י\rb* \rb did He consult|נוֹעָץ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb to enlighten Him,|וַיְבִינֵ֔הוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and who taught Him|וַֽיְלַמְּדֵ֖הוּ\rb* \rb the paths|בְּאֹ֣רַח\rb* \rb of justice?|מִשְׁפָּ֑ט\rb*
\q1 \rb Who imparted|וַיְלַמְּדֵ֣הוּ\rb* \rb knowledge to Him|דַ֔עַת\rb*
