\q2 \rb He will faithfully|לֶאֱמֶ֖ת\rb* \rb bring forth|יוֹצִ֥יא\rb* \rb justice.|מִשְׁפָּֽט׃\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb He will not|לֹ֤א\rb* \rb grow weak|יִכְהֶה֙\rb*\rb |וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb or discouraged|יָר֔וּץ\rb*\f + \fr 42:4 \ft Or \fqa bruised\f*
