\q1 \rb if you honor it|וְכִבַּדְתּוֹ֙\rb* \rb by not going|מֵעֲשׂ֣וֹת\rb* \rb your own way|דְּרָכֶ֔יךָ\rb*
\q2 \rb or seeking|מִמְּצ֥וֹא\rb* \rb your own pleasure|חֶפְצְךָ֖\rb* \rb or speaking|וְדַבֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb idle words,|דָּבָֽר׃\rb*
