\q1 \v 11 \rb We all|כֻּלָּ֔נוּ\rb* \rb growl|נֶהֱמֶ֤ה\rb* \rb like bears|כַדֻּבִּים֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and moan|הָגֹ֣ה\rb*\rb |נֶהְגֶּ֑ה\rb* \rb like doves.|וְכַיּוֹנִ֖ים\rb*
\q1 \rb We hope|נְקַוֶּ֤ה\rb* \rb for justice,|לַמִּשְׁפָּט֙\rb* \rb but find none,|וָאַ֔יִן\rb*
