\q1 \v 14 \rb So justice|מִשְׁפָּ֔ט\rb* \rb is turned away,|וְהֻסַּ֤ג\rb*\rb |אָחוֹר֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and righteousness|וּצְדָקָ֖ה\rb* \rb stands|תַּעֲמֹ֑ד\rb* \rb at a distance.|מֵרָח֣וֹק\rb*
\q1 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb truth|אֱמֶ֔ת\rb* \rb has stumbled|כָשְׁלָ֤ה\rb* \rb in the public square,|בָֽרְחוֹב֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and honesty|וּנְכֹחָ֖ה\rb* \rb cannot|לֹא־\rb*\rb |תוּכַ֥ל\rb* \rb enter.|לָבֽוֹא׃\rb*
\q1 \v 15 \rb Truth|הָֽאֱמֶת֙\rb* \rb is|וַתְּהִ֤י\rb* \rb missing,|נֶעְדֶּ֔רֶת\rb*
\q2 \rb and whoever turns|וְסָ֥ר\rb* \rb from evil|מֵרָ֖ע\rb* \rb becomes prey.|מִשְׁתּוֹלֵ֑ל\rb*
\b 
