\s1 The Covenant of the Redeemer
\q1 \v 18 \rb So He will repay|יְשַׁלֵּ֔ם\rb* \rb according to|כְּעַ֤ל\rb* \rb their deeds:|גְּמֻלוֹת֙\rb*\rb |כְּעַ֣ל\rb*
