\q2 \rb to those in Jacob|בְּיַֽעֲקֹ֑ב\rb* \rb who turn|וּלְשָׁבֵ֥י\rb* \rb from transgression,|פֶ֖שַׁע\rb*\f + \fr 59:20 \ft LXX \fqa to remove godlessness from Jacob\ft ; cited in \ref Romans 11:26|ROM 11:26\ref*\f*”
\qr \rb declares|נְאֻ֖ם\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 21 \rb “As for Me,|וַאֲנִ֗י\rb* \rb this|זֹ֣את\rb* \rb is My covenant|בְּרִיתִ֤י\rb* \rb with them,”|אוֹתָם֙\rb*\f + \fr 59:21 \ft Cited in \ref Romans 11:27|ROM 11:27\ref*\f* \rb says|אָמַ֣ר\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb “My Spirit|רוּחִי֙\rb* \rb will not depart|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb from you,|עָלֶ֔יךָ\rb*\f + \fr 59:21 \ft Literally \fqa My Spirit, who is upon you,\f* \rb and My words|וּדְבָרַ֖י\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb I have put|שַׂ֣מְתִּי\rb* \rb in your mouth|בְּפִ֑יךָ\rb* \rb will not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb depart|יָמ֡וּשׁוּ\rb* \rb from your mouth|מִפִּיךָ֩\rb* \rb or from the mouths|וּמִפִּ֨י\rb* \rb of your children|זַרְעֲךָ֜\rb* \rb and|וּמִפִּ֨י\rb*\rb |זֶ֤רַע\rb* \rb grandchildren,|זַרְעֲךָ֙\rb* \rb from now on|מֵעַתָּ֖ה\rb* \rb and|וְעַד־\rb* \rb forevermore,”|עוֹלָֽם׃ס\rb* \rb says|אָמַ֣ר\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*
\c 60
\s1 Future Glory for Zion
\q1 \v 1 \rb Arise,|ק֥וּמִי\rb* \rb shine,|א֖וֹרִי\rb* \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb your light|אוֹרֵ֑ךְ\rb* \rb has come,|בָ֣א\rb*
\q2 \rb and the glory|וּכְב֥וֹד\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb rises|זָרָֽח׃\rb* \rb upon you.|עָלַ֥יִךְ\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb behold,|הִנֵּ֤ה\rb* \rb darkness|הַחֹ֙שֶׁךְ֙\rb* \rb covers|יְכַסֶּה־\rb* \rb the earth,|אֶ֔רֶץ\rb*
\q2 \rb and thick darkness|וַעֲרָפֶ֖ל\rb* \rb is over the peoples;|לְאֻמִּ֑ים\rb*
\q1 \rb but the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb will rise|יִזְרַ֣ח\rb* \rb upon you,|וְעָלַ֙יִךְ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and His glory|וּכְבוֹד֖וֹ\rb* \rb will appear|יֵרָאֶֽה׃\rb* \rb over you.|עָלַ֥יִךְ\rb*
\q1 \v 3 \rb Nations|גוֹיִ֖ם\rb* \rb will come|וְהָלְכ֥וּ\rb* \rb to your light,|לְאוֹרֵ֑ךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb and kings|וּמְלָכִ֖ים\rb* \rb to the brightness|לְנֹ֥גַהּ\rb* \rb of your dawn.|זַרְחֵֽךְ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \rb Lift up|שְׂאִֽי־\rb* \rb your eyes|עֵינַ֙יִךְ֙\rb* \rb and look|וּרְאִ֔י\rb* \rb around:|סָבִ֤יב\rb*
\q2 \rb They all|כֻּלָּ֖ם\rb* \rb gather|נִקְבְּצ֣וּ\rb* \rb and come|בָֽאוּ־\rb* \rb to you;|לָ֑ךְ\rb*
\q1 \rb your sons|בָּנַ֙יִךְ֙\rb* \rb will come|יָבֹ֔אוּ\rb* \rb from afar,|מֵרָח֣וֹק\rb*
\q2 \rb and your daughters|וּבְנֹתַ֖יִךְ\rb* \rb will be carried|תֵּאָמַֽנָה׃\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb the arm.|צַ֥ד\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb Then|אָ֤ז\rb* \rb you will look|תִּרְאִי֙\rb* \rb and be radiant,|וְנָהַ֔רְתְּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and your heart|לְבָבֵ֑ךְ\rb* \rb will tremble|וּפָחַ֥ד\rb* \rb and swell with joy,|וְרָחַ֖ב\rb*
\q1 \rb because|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the riches|הֲמ֣וֹן\rb* \rb of the sea|יָ֔ם\rb* \rb will be brought|יֵהָפֵ֤ךְ\rb* \rb to you,|עָלַ֙יִךְ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and the wealth|חֵ֥יל\rb* \rb of the nations|גּוֹיִ֖ם\rb* \rb will come|יָבֹ֥אוּ\rb* \rb to you.|לָֽךְ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb Caravans|שִֽׁפְעַ֨ת\rb* \rb of camels|גְּמַלִּ֜ים\rb* \rb will cover your land,|תְּכַסֵּ֗ךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb young camels|בִּכְרֵ֤י\rb* \rb of Midian|מִדְיָן֙\rb* \rb and Ephah,|וְעֵיפָ֔ה\rb*
