\q2 \rb and proclaiming|יְבַשֵּֽׂרוּ׃\rb* \rb the praises|וּתְהִלֹּ֥ת\rb* \rb of the LORD.|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*
\q1 \v 7 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb the flocks|צֹ֤אן\rb* \rb of Kedar|קֵדָר֙\rb* \rb will be gathered|יִקָּ֣בְצוּ\rb* \rb to you;|לָ֔ךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb the rams|אֵילֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Nebaioth|נְבָי֖וֹת\rb* \rb will serve you|יְשָׁרְת֑וּנֶךְ\rb*
\q1 \rb and go up|יַעֲל֤וּ\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb My altar|מִזְבְּחִ֔י\rb* \rb with acceptance;|רָצוֹן֙\rb*
\q2 \rb I will adorn|אֲפָאֵֽר׃\rb* \rb My glorious|תִּפְאַרְתִּ֖י\rb* \rb house.|וּבֵ֥ית\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \rb Who|מִי־\rb* \rb are these|אֵ֖לֶּה\rb* \rb who fly|תְּעוּפֶ֑ינָה\rb* \rb like clouds,|כָּעָ֣ב\rb*
\q2 \rb like doves|וְכַיּוֹנִ֖ים\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb their shelters?|אֲרֻבֹּתֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*
