\q2 \rb it|וְהַגּוֹיִ֖ם\rb* \rb will be utterly destroyed.|חָרֹ֥ב\rb*\rb |יֶחֱרָֽבוּ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \rb The glory|כְּב֤וֹד\rb* \rb of Lebanon|הַלְּבָנוֹן֙\rb* \rb will come|יָב֔וֹא\rb* \rb to you—|אֵלַ֣יִךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb its cypress,|בְּר֛וֹשׁ\rb*\f + \fr 60:13 \ft Or \fqa pine \ft or \fqa juniper \ft or \fqa fir\f* \rb elm,|תִּדְהָ֥ר\rb* \rb and boxwood|וּתְאַשּׁ֖וּר\rb* \rb together—|יַחְדָּ֑ו\rb*
