\q1 \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb who reviled you|מְנַֽאֲצָ֑יִךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb will fall facedown|וְהִֽשְׁתַּחֲו֛וּ\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb your feet|כַּפּ֥וֹת\rb*\rb |רַגְלַ֖יִךְ\rb*
\q1 \rb and call|וְקָ֤רְאוּ\rb* \rb you|לָךְ֙\rb* \rb the City|עִ֣יר\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb Zion|צִיּ֖וֹן\rb* \rb of the Holy One|קְד֥וֹשׁ\rb* \rb of Israel.|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 15 \rb Whereas|תַּ֧חַת\rb* \rb you have been|הֱיוֹתֵ֛ךְ\rb* \rb forsaken|עֲזוּבָ֥ה\rb* \rb and despised,|וּשְׂנוּאָ֖ה\rb*
