\q2 \rb nor|לֹא־\rb* \rb the brightness|וּלְנֹ֕גַהּ\rb* \rb of the moon|הַיָּרֵ֖חַ\rb* \rb shine|יָאִ֣יר\rb* \rb on your night;|לָ֑ךְ\rb*\f + \fr 60:19 \ft DSS, LXX, and Targum Yonaton; MT \fqa shine on you\f*
\q1 \rb for the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb will be|וְהָיָה־\rb* \rb your|לָ֤ךְ\rb* \rb everlasting|עוֹלָ֔ם\rb* \rb light,|לְא֣וֹר\rb*
