\q2 \rb do not|אַל־\rb* \rb come near|תִּגַּשׁ־\rb* \rb me,|בִּ֖י\rb* \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb I am holier than you!’|קְדַשְׁתִּ֑יךָ\rb*
\q1 \rb Such people|אֵ֚לֶּה\rb* \rb are smoke|עָשָׁ֣ן\rb* \rb in My nostrils,|בְּאַפִּ֔י\rb*
