\s1 A New Heaven and a New Earth
\r \ref Revelation 21:1–8|REV 21:1-8\ref*)
\q1 \v 17 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb behold,|הִנְנִ֥י\rb* \rb I will create|בוֹרֵ֛א\rb*
