\q2 \rb in what|אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֣י\rb* \rb create;|בוֹרֵ֑א\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּי֩\rb*\rb |הִנְנִ֨י\rb* \rb I will create|בוֹרֵ֧א\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Jerusalem|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֛ם\rb* \rb to be a joy|גִּילָ֖ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and its people|וְעַמָּ֥הּ\rb* \rb to be a delight.|מָשֽׂוֹשׂ׃\rb*\rb |אִם־\rb*
\q1 \v 19 \rb I will rejoice|וְגַלְתִּ֥י\rb* \rb in Jerusalem|בִירוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and take delight|וְשַׂשְׂתִּ֣י\rb* \rb in My people.|בְעַמִּ֑י\rb*
