\q2 \rb nor|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb plant|יִטְּע֖וּ\rb* \rb for others|וְאַחֵ֣ר\rb* \rb to eat.|יֹאכֵ֑ל\rb*
\q1 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb as is the lifetime|יְמֵ֣י\rb* \rb of a tree,|הָעֵץ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb so will be the days|כִימֵ֤י\rb* \rb of My people,|עַמִּ֔י\rb*
\q1 \rb and My chosen ones|בְחִירָֽי׃\rb* \rb will fully enjoy|יְבַלּ֥וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb the work|וּמַעֲשֵׂ֥ה\rb* \rb of their hands.|יְדֵיהֶ֖ם\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 23 \rb They will not|לֹ֤א\rb* \rb labor|יִֽיגְעוּ֙\rb* \rb in vain|לָרִ֔יק\rb*
\q2 \rb or|וְלֹ֥א\rb* \rb bear children|יֵלְד֖וּ\rb* \rb doomed to disaster;|לַבֶּהָלָ֑ה\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb they|הֵ֔מָּה\rb* \rb will be a people|זֶ֜רַע\rb* \rb blessed|בְּרוּכֵ֤י\rb* \rb by the LORD—|יְהוָה֙\rb*
\q2 \rb they and their descendants|וְצֶאֱצָאֵיהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb with them.|אִתָּֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 24 \rb |וְהָיָ֥ה\rb* \rb Even before|טֶֽרֶם־\rb* \rb they call,|יִקְרָ֖אוּ\rb* \rb I|וַאֲנִ֣י\rb* \rb will answer,|אֶעֱנֶ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and while they|הֵ֥ם\rb* \rb are still|ע֛וֹד\rb* \rb speaking,|מְדַבְּרִ֖ים\rb* \rb I|וַאֲנִ֥י\rb* \rb will hear.|אֶשְׁמָֽע׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 25 \rb The wolf|זְאֵ֨ב\rb* \rb and the lamb|וְטָלֶ֜ה\rb* \rb will feed together,|יִרְע֣וּ\rb*\rb |כְאֶחָ֗ד\rb*
\q2 \rb and the lion|וְאַרְיֵה֙\rb* \rb will eat|יֹֽאכַל־\rb* \rb straw|תֶּ֔בֶן\rb* \rb like the ox,|כַּבָּקָ֣ר\rb*
\q1 \rb but the food|לַחְמ֑וֹ\rb* \rb of the serpent|וְנָחָ֖שׁ\rb*\f + \fr 65:25 \ft Hebrew \fqa nachash\ft ; translated in most cases as \fqa snake\f* \rb will be dust.|עָפָ֣ר\rb*
\q2 \rb They will neither|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb harm|יָרֵ֧עוּ\rb* \rb nor|וְלֹֽא־\rb* \rb destroy|יַשְׁחִ֛יתוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb on all My|בְּכָל־\rb* \rb holy|קָדְשִׁ֖י\rb* \rb mountain,”|הַ֥ר\rb*
\qr \rb says|אָמַ֥ר\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃ס\rb*
\c 66
\s1 Heaven Is My Throne
\p \v 1 \rb This is what|כֹּ֚ה\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb says:|אָמַ֣ר\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “Heaven|הַשָּׁמַ֣יִם\rb* \rb is My throne,|כִּסְאִ֔י\rb*
\q2 \rb and earth|וְהָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb is My footstool.|הֲדֹ֣ם\rb*\rb |רַגְלָ֑י\rb*
\q1 \rb What kind|אֵי־\rb*\rb |זֶ֥ה\rb* \rb of house|בַ֙יִת֙\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb will you build|תִּבְנוּ־\rb* \rb for Me?|לִ֔י\rb*
\q2 \rb Or where will|וְאֵי־\rb*\rb |זֶ֥ה\rb* \rb My place|מָק֖וֹם\rb* \rb of repose be?|מְנוּחָתִֽי׃\rb*
\q1 \v 2 \rb Has not My hand|יָדִ֣י\rb* \rb made|עָשָׂ֔תָה\rb* \rb all|כָל־\rb* \rb these things?|אֵ֙לֶּה֙\rb*\f + \fr 66:2 \ft Cited in \ref Acts 7:49–50|ACT 7:49-50\ref*\f*
\q2 \rb And so they|אֵ֖לֶּה\rb* \rb came into being,”|וַיִּהְי֥וּ\rb*
\qr \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q1 \rb |וְאֶל־\rb* \rb “This is the one|זֶ֣ה\rb* \rb I will esteem:|אַבִּ֔יט\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb*
\q2 \rb he who is humble|עָנִי֙\rb* \rb and contrite|וּנְכֵה־\rb* \rb in spirit,|ר֔וּחַ\rb*
\q2 \rb who trembles|וְחָרֵ֖ד\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb My word.|דְּבָרִֽי׃\rb*\rb |כָּל־\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 3 \rb Whoever slaughters|שׁוֹחֵ֨ט\rb* \rb an ox|הַשּׁ֜וֹר\rb* \rb is like one who slays|מַכֵּה־\rb* \rb a man;|אִ֗ישׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb whoever sacrifices|זוֹבֵ֤חַ\rb* \rb a lamb|הַשֶּׂה֙\rb* \rb is like one who breaks a dog’s|כֶּ֔לֶב\rb* \rb neck;|עֹ֣רֵֽף\rb*
\q1 \rb whoever presents|מַעֲלֵ֤ה\rb* \rb a grain offering|מִנְחָה֙\rb* \rb is like one who offers|מַזְכִּ֥יר\rb* \rb pig’s|חֲזִ֔יר\rb* \rb blood;|דַּם־\rb*
\q2 \rb whoever offers frankincense|לְבֹנָ֖ה\rb* \rb is like one who blesses|מְבָ֣רֵֽךְ\rb* \rb an idol.|אָ֑וֶן\rb*
\q1 \rb Indeed,|גַּם־\rb* \rb they|הֵ֗מָּה\rb* \rb have chosen|בָּֽחֲרוּ֙\rb* \rb their own ways|בְּדַרְכֵיהֶ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and delighted|חָפֵֽצָה׃\rb* \rb in their abominations.|וּבְשִׁקּוּצֵיהֶ֖ם\rb*\rb |נַפְשָׁ֥ם\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb So|גַּם־\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֞י\rb* \rb will choose|אֶבְחַ֣ר\rb* \rb their punishment|בְּתַעֲלֻלֵיהֶ֗ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and I will bring|אָבִ֣יא\rb* \rb terror|וּמְגֽוּרֹתָם֙\rb* \rb upon them,|לָהֶ֔ם\rb*
\q1 \rb because|יַ֤עַן\rb* \rb I called|קָרָ֙אתִי֙\rb* \rb and no|וְאֵ֣ין\rb* \rb one answered,|עוֹנֶ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb I spoke|דִּבַּ֖רְתִּי\rb* \rb and no one|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb listened.|שָׁמֵ֑עוּ\rb*
\q1 \rb But they did|וַיַּעֲשׂ֤וּ\rb* \rb evil|הָרַע֙\rb* \rb in My sight|בְּעֵינַ֔י\rb*
\q2 \rb and chose|בָּחָֽרוּ׃ס\rb* \rb that in which|וּבַאֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb I did not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb delight.”|חָפַ֖צְתִּי\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \rb You who tremble|הַחֲרֵדִ֖ים\rb* \rb at|אֶל־\rb* \rb His word,|דְּבָר֑וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb hear|שִׁמְעוּ֙\rb* \rb the word|דְּבַר־\rb* \rb of the LORD:|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “Your brothers|אֲחֵיכֶ֨ם\rb* \rb who hate you|שֹׂנְאֵיכֶ֜ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and exclude you|מְנַדֵּיכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb because of|לְמַ֤עַן\rb* \rb My name|שְׁמִי֙\rb*
\q1 \rb have said,|אָמְרוּ֩\rb* \rb ‘Let the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb be glorified|יִכְבַּ֣ד\rb*
\q2 \rb that we may see|וְנִרְאֶ֥ה\rb* \rb your joy!’|בְשִׂמְחַתְכֶ֖ם\rb*
\q2 \rb But they|וְהֵ֥ם\rb* \rb will be put to shame.”|יֵבֹֽשׁוּ׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 6 \rb Hear|ק֤וֹל\rb* \rb the uproar|שָׁאוֹן֙\rb* \rb from the city;|מֵעִ֔יר\rb*
\q2 \rb listen to the voice|ק֖וֹל\rb* \rb from the temple!|מֵֽהֵיכָ֑ל\rb*
\q1 \rb It is the voice|ק֣וֹל\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb repaying|מְשַׁלֵּ֥ם\rb* \rb His enemies|לְאֹיְבָֽיו׃\rb* \rb what they deserve!|גְּמ֖וּל\rb*
\s1 Rejoice with Jerusalem
\q1 \v 7 \rb “Before|בְּטֶ֥רֶם\rb* \rb she was in labor,|תָּחִ֖יל\rb* \rb she gave birth;|יָלָ֑דָה\rb*
\q2 \rb before|בְּטֶ֨רֶם\rb*\rb |יָב֥וֹא\rb* \rb she was in pain,|חֵ֛בֶל\rb* \rb she delivered|וְהִמְלִ֥יטָה\rb* \rb a boy.|זָכָֽר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb Who|מִֽי־\rb* \rb has heard|שָׁמַ֣ע\rb* \rb of such as this?|כָּזֹ֗את\rb*
\q2 \rb Who|מִ֤י\rb* \rb has seen|רָאָה֙\rb* \rb such things?|כָּאֵ֔לֶּה\rb*
\q1 \rb Can a country|אֶ֙רֶץ֙\rb* \rb be born|הֲי֤וּחַל\rb* \rb in a|אֶחָ֔ד\rb* \rb day|בְּי֣וֹם\rb*
\q2 \rb or|אִם־\rb* \rb a nation|גּ֖וֹי\rb* \rb be delivered|יִוָּ֥לֵֽד\rb* \rb in an instant?|פַּ֣עַם\rb*\rb |אֶחָ֑ת\rb*
\q1 \rb Yet|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb as soon as Zion|צִיּ֖וֹן\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb was in labor,|חָ֛לָה\rb*\rb |גַּם־\rb*
\q2 \rb she gave birth to|יָלְדָ֥ה\rb* \rb her children.|בָּנֶֽיהָ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb Shall I|הַאֲנִ֥י\rb* \rb bring a baby to the point of birth|אַשְׁבִּ֛יר\rb* \rb and not|וְלֹ֥א\rb* \rb deliver it?”|אוֹלִ֖יד\rb*
\q2 \rb says|יֹאמַ֣ר\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q1 \rb “Or|אִם־\rb* \rb will I|אֲנִ֧י\rb* \rb who deliver|הַמּוֹלִ֛יד\rb* \rb close the womb?”|וְעָצַ֖רְתִּי\rb*
\q2 \rb says|אָמַ֥ר\rb* \rb your God.|אֱלֹהָֽיִךְ׃ס\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 10 \rb Be glad|שִׂמְח֧וּ\rb* \rb for|אֶת־\rb* \rb Jerusalem|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֛ם\rb* \rb and rejoice|וְגִ֥ילוּ\rb* \rb over her,|בָ֖הּ\rb*
\q2 \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb who love her.|אֹהֲבֶ֑יהָ\rb*
\q1 \rb Rejoice greatly|שִׂ֤ישׂוּ\rb*\rb |מָשׂ֔וֹשׂ\rb* \rb with her,|אִתָּהּ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb who mourn|הַמִּֽתְאַבְּלִ֖ים\rb* \rb over her,|עָלֶֽיהָ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 11 \rb so that|לְמַ֤עַן\rb* \rb you may nurse|תִּֽינְקוּ֙\rb* \rb and be satisfied|וּשְׂבַעְתֶּ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb at her comforting|תַּנְחֻמֶ֑יהָ\rb*\rb |לְמַ֧עַן\rb* \rb breasts;|מִשֹּׁ֖ד\rb*
\q1 \rb you may drink deeply|תָּמֹ֛צּוּ\rb* \rb and delight yourselves|וְהִתְעַנַּגְתֶּ֖ם\rb*
\q2 \rb in her glorious|כְּבוֹדָֽהּ׃ס\rb* \rb abundance.|מִזִּ֥יז\rb*
\p \v 12 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb this is what|כֹ֣ה׀\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֗ה\rb*\rb |הִנְנִ֣י\rb* \rb says:|אָמַ֣ר\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “I will extend|נֹטֶֽה־\rb* \rb peace|שָׁל֜וֹם\rb* \rb to her|אֵ֠לֶיהָ\rb* \rb like a river,|כְּנָהָ֨ר\rb*
\q2 \rb and the wealth|כְּב֥וֹד\rb* \rb of nations|גּוֹיִ֖ם\rb* \rb like a flowing|שׁוֹטֵ֛ף\rb* \rb stream;|וּכְנַ֧חַל\rb*
\q1 \rb you will nurse|וִֽינַקְתֶּ֑ם\rb* \rb and be carried|תִּנָּשֵׂ֔אוּ\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb her arm,|צַד֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and bounced|תְּשָׁעֳשָֽׁעוּ׃\rb* \rb upon|וְעַל־\rb* \rb her knees.|בִּרְכַּ֖יִם\rb*
\q1 \v 13 \rb |כְּאִ֕ישׁ\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb As a mother|אִמּ֖וֹ\rb* \rb comforts her son,|תְּנַחֲמֶ֑נּוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb so|כֵּ֤ן\rb*\rb |אָֽנֹכִי֙\rb* \rb will I comfort you,|אֲנַ֣חֶמְכֶ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb and you will be consoled|תְּנֻחָֽמוּ׃\rb* \rb over Jerusalem.”|וּבִירֽוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 14 \rb When you see,|וּרְאִיתֶם֙\rb* \rb you|לִבְּכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb will rejoice,|וְשָׂ֣שׂ\rb*
\q2 \rb and you|וְעַצְמוֹתֵיכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb will flourish|תִפְרַ֑חְנָה\rb* \rb like grass;|כַּדֶּ֣שֶׁא\rb*
\q1 \rb then the hand|יַד־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb will be revealed|וְנוֹדְעָ֤ה\rb* \rb to|אֶת־\rb* \rb His servants,|עֲבָדָ֔יו\rb*
\q2 \rb but His wrath will be shown|וְזָעַ֖ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb to His enemies.|אֹיְבָֽיו׃\rb*
\s1 Final Judgments against the Wicked
\q1 \v 15 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb behold,|הִנֵּ֤ה\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb* \rb will come|יָב֔וֹא\rb* \rb with fire—|בָּאֵ֣שׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb His chariots|מַרְכְּבֹתָ֑יו\rb* \rb are like a whirlwind—|וְכַסּוּפָ֖ה\rb*
\q1 \rb to execute|לְהָשִׁ֤יב\rb* \rb His anger|אַפּ֔וֹ\rb* \rb with fury|בְּחֵמָה֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and His rebuke|וְגַעֲרָת֖וֹ\rb* \rb with flames|בְּלַהֲבֵי־\rb* \rb of fire.|אֵֽשׁ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 16 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb by fire|בָאֵשׁ֙\rb* \rb and by His sword,|וּבְחַרְבּ֖וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb will execute judgment|נִשְׁפָּ֔ט\rb* \rb on|אֶת־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb flesh,|בָּשָׂ֑ר\rb*
\q2 \rb and many|וְרַבּ֖וּ\rb* \rb will be slain|חַֽלְלֵ֥י\rb* \rb by the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 17 \rb “Those who consecrate|הַמִּתְקַדְּשִׁ֨ים\rb* \rb and purify themselves|וְהַמִּֽטַּהֲרִ֜ים\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb enter the groves—|הַגַּנּ֗וֹת\rb*  \rb to follow|אַחַ֤ר\rb* \rb one|אֶחָד\rb* \rb in the center|בַּתָּ֔וֶךְ\rb* \rb of those who eat|אֹֽכְלֵי֙\rb* \rb the flesh|בְּשַׂ֣ר\rb* \rb of swine|הַחֲזִ֔יר\rb* \rb and vermin|וְהַשֶּׁ֖קֶץ\rb* \rb and rats—|וְהָעַכְבָּ֑ר\rb*  \rb will perish|יָסֻ֖פוּ\rb* \rb together,”|יַחְדָּ֥ו\rb* \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 18 \rb “And I, knowing|וְאָנֹכִ֗י\rb* \rb their deeds|מַעֲשֵׂיהֶם֙\rb* \rb and thoughts,|וּמַחְשְׁבֹ֣תֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb am coming|בָּאָ֕ה\rb*\f + \fr 66:18 \ft Literally \fqa And I, their deeds and their thoughts, am coming\f* \rb to gather|לְקַבֵּ֥ץ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb nations|הַגּוֹיִ֖ם\rb* \rb and tongues,|וְהַלְּשֹׁנ֑וֹת\rb* \rb and they will come|וּבָ֖אוּ\rb* \rb and see|וְרָא֥וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb My glory.|כְּבוֹדִֽי׃\rb*
\p \v 19 \rb I will establish|וְשַׂמְתִּ֨י\rb* \rb a sign|א֗וֹת\rb* \rb among them,|בָהֶ֜ם\rb* \rb and I will send|וְשִׁלַּחְתִּ֣י\rb* \rb survivors|פְּ֠לֵיטִים\rb* \rb from among them|מֵהֶ֣ם׀\rb* \rb to|אֶֽל־\rb* \rb the nations—|הַגּוֹיִ֞ם\rb*  \rb to Tarshish,|תַּרְשִׁ֨ישׁ\rb* \rb Put,|פּ֥וּל\rb* \rb and the archers|מֹ֥שְׁכֵי\rb*\rb |קֶ֖שֶׁת\rb* \rb of Lud;|וְל֛וּד\rb* \rb to Tubal,|תֻּבַ֣ל\rb* \rb Javan,|וְיָוָ֑ן\rb* \rb and the islands|הָאִיִּ֣ים\rb*\f + \fr 66:19 \ft Or \fqa coastlands\f* \rb far away|הָרְחֹקִ֗ים\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb have not|לֹא־\rb* \rb heard|שָׁמְע֤וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb of My fame|שִׁמְעִי֙\rb*\rb |וְלֹא־\rb* \rb or seen|רָא֣וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb My glory.|כְּבוֹדִ֔י\rb*
\p \rb So they will proclaim|וְהִגִּ֥ידוּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb My glory|כְּבוֹדִ֖י\rb* \rb among the nations.|בַּגּוֹיִֽם׃\rb* \v 20 \rb And they will bring|וְהֵבִ֣יאוּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb your brothers|אֲחֵיכֶ֣ם\rb* \rb from all|מִכָּל־\rb* \rb the nations|הַגּוֹיִ֣ם׀\rb* \rb as a gift|מִנְחָ֣ה׀\rb* \rb to the LORD|לַֽיהוָ֡ה\rb* \rb on horses|בַּסּוּסִ֡ים\rb* \rb and chariots|וּ֠בָרֶכֶב\rb* \rb and wagons,|וּבַצַּבִּ֨ים\rb* \rb on mules|וּבַפְּרָדִ֜ים\rb* \rb and camels,|וּבַכִּרְכָּר֗וֹת\rb* \rb to|עַ֣ל\rb* \rb My holy|קָדְשִׁ֛י\rb* \rb mountain|הַ֥ר\rb* \rb Jerusalem,”|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֖ם\rb* \rb says|אָמַ֣ר\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb* \rb “just as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb the Israelites|בְנֵ֨י\rb*\rb |יִשְׂרָאֵ֧ל\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb bring|יָבִיאוּ֩\rb* \rb an offering|הַמִּנְחָ֛ה\rb* \rb in a clean|טָה֖וֹר\rb* \rb vessel|בִּכְלִ֥י\rb* \rb to the house|בֵּ֥ית\rb* \rb of the LORD.”|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\p \v 21 \rb “And I will|וְגַם־\rb* \rb select|אֶקַּ֛ח\rb* \rb some of them|מֵהֶ֥ם\rb* \rb as priests|לַכֹּהֲנִ֥ים\rb* \rb and Levites,”|לַלְוִיִּ֖ם\rb* \rb says|אָמַ֥ר\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 22 \rb “For|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb just as|כַאֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb the new|הַ֠חֳדָשִׁים\rb* \rb heavens|הַשָּׁמַ֣יִם\rb* \rb and the new|הַחֲדָשָׁ֜ה\rb* \rb earth,|וְהָאָ֨רֶץ\rb*\f + \fr 66:22 \ft LXX \fqa the new heaven and the new earth\ft ; see also \ref Isaiah 65:17|ISA 65:17\ref* and Revelation 21:1.\f*
\q2 \rb which|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֥י\rb* \rb will make,|עֹשֶׂ֛ה\rb* \rb will endure|עֹמְדִ֥ים\rb* \rb before Me,”|לְפָנַ֖י\rb*
\qr \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb “so|כֵּ֛ן\rb* \rb your descendants|זַרְעֲכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb and your name|וְשִׁמְכֶֽם׃\rb* \rb will endure.|יַעֲמֹ֥ד\rb*
\q1 \v 23 \rb |וְהָיָ֗ה\rb* \rb From|מִֽדֵּי־\rb* \rb one New Moon|חֹ֙דֶשׁ֙\rb* \rb to another|בְּחָדְשׁ֔וֹ\rb*
\q2 \rb and from|וּמִדֵּ֥י\rb* \rb one Sabbath|שַׁבָּ֖ת\rb* \rb to another,|בְּשַׁבַּתּ֑וֹ\rb*
\q1 \rb all|כָל־\rb* \rb mankind|בָּשָׂ֛ר\rb* \rb will come|יָב֧וֹא\rb* \rb to worship|לְהִשְׁתַּחֲוֺ֥ת\rb* \rb before Me,”|לְפָנַ֖י\rb*
\q2 \rb says|אָמַ֥ר\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 24 \rb “As they go forth,|וְיָצְא֣וּ\rb* \rb they will see|וְרָא֔וּ\rb* \rb the corpses|בְּפִגְרֵי֙\rb*
\q2 \rb of the men|הָאֲנָשִׁ֔ים\rb* \rb who have rebelled|הַפֹּשְׁעִ֖ים\rb* \rb against Me;|בִּ֑י\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb their worm|תוֹלַעְתָּ֞ם\rb* \rb will never|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb die,|תָמ֗וּת\rb*
\q2 \rb their fire|וְאִשָּׁם֙\rb* \rb will never|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb be quenched,|תִכְבֶּ֔ה\rb*\f + \fr 66:24 \ft Cited in \ref Mark 9:48|MRK 9:48\ref*\f*
\q1 \rb and they will be|וְהָי֥וּ\rb* \rb a horror|דֵרָא֖וֹן\rb*
\q2 \rb to all|לְכָל־\rb* \rb mankind.”|בָּשָֽׂר׃\rb*
